Third-party components

SSH, SFTP and SCP transport, authentication and host-key handling are
provided by libssh (https://www.libssh.org, LGPL-2.1-or-later), linked
dynamically from the system. Hashing and PPK key conversion use OpenSSL's libcrypto
(Apache-2.0). Argon2 key derivation for encrypted PPK v3 files uses the
system libargon2 (CC0 1.0 or Apache-2.0, at the user's option). Neither
library is vendored into this tree.

The browser terminal in the graphical client embeds xterm.js 6.0.0 and
its FitAddon (source/gui/web/vendor/, MIT licence; the full notice is in
source/gui/web/vendor/LICENSE-xterm.txt).

